cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Jataayu: An Effect-Boundary Security Guard for AI Agents"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rallabandi
    given-names: Sai Krishna
repository-code: "https://github.com/saikrishnarallabandi/jataayu"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A deterministic action-authorization primitive for tool-using AI agents.
  Rather than classifying whether input text looks malicious, Jataayu gates
  the effect an action would have, using provenance and taint tracking, so
  the guarantee does not depend on a detector firing.
keywords:
  - prompt-injection
  - ai-agent-security
  - llm-security
  - guardrails
